			"notes": "BeamCraft release for Windows. BeamCraft is a one-player experience that runs on a single PC. You must own and install both BeamNG.drive and Minecraft.\n\n## Downloads\n- `BeamCraft-v0.1.0.zip`: complete project and built Fabric mod. Extract it and launch with `play.bat`; the launcher sets up and starts the local game components.\n- `bng-bridge-v0.1.0.jar`: the Fabric mod by itself. For the complete launcher and BeamNG extension, use the project ZIP.\n\n## Tested setup\n- BeamNG.drive 0.39.4\n- Minecraft 1.21.1 with Fabric\n- One player on one PC; shared/network play is not supported.\n- G923 H-shifter and clutch work in-game. Wheel support is experimental, force feedback is not implemented, and the rendered steering wheel stays static."
		},
